@*  INJ-004 Production Entry user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">INJ-004 · @PopLang.T("ProductionEntry")</div>
        <div class="help-sub">@PopLang.T("OneRowPerCycle")</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">INJ-004 · STATION · LINE</text>

            @* ① WO context *@
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="14" y="68" width="692" height="78" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">▼ ACTIVE WO</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="118" style="font-size:18px;">WO-2026-0529-007 · DOOR TRIM LH</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="138">182 / 384 EA  ·  Cycle target 42 sec</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            @* ② Entry grid *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="160" width="692" height="230" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="180">▼ NEW CYCLE</text>
            <rect x="40"  y="200" width="140" height="64" rx="6" fill="rgba(0,0,0,.4)" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,.3)" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="50" y="220">GOOD QTY</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="60" y="252" style="font-size:24px;">4</text>

            <rect x="200" y="200" width="140" height="64" rx="6" fill="rgba(0,0,0,.4)" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,.3)" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="210" y="220">CYCLE SEC</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="220" y="252" style="font-size:24px;">42</text>

            <rect x="360" y="200" width="180" height="64" rx="6" fill="rgba(0,0,0,.4)" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,.3)" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="370" y="220">MOLD</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="380" y="252" style="font-size:18px;">MOLD-INJ-008</text>

            <rect x="560" y="200" width="120" height="64" rx="6" fill="rgba(220,38,38,.2)" stroke="rgba(252,165,165,.4)" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="570" y="220">DEFECT?</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="620" y="252" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:18px;">▢</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="170" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="170">2</text>

            @* ③ Save bar *@
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="40" y="290" width="640" height="60" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="360" y="328" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:22px;">✓ SAVE CYCLE</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="50" cy="300" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="50" y="300">3</text>

            @* nav *@
            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="360" y="450" text-anchor="middle">▶ INJ-002 · 05 · ... · LOGOUT</text>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">READ THE SCREEN</span><span class="h-sec-ko">화면 읽기</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Active WO banner. If wrong, go back to INJ-003.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">현재 활성 WO. 다르면 INJ-003 에서 변경.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Cycle entry — Good Qty, Cycle Sec, Mold, optional Defect flag.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">사이클 입력 — 양품 수량 · 사이클 초 · 금형 · 불량 플래그.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">Defect flag → opens INJ-005 after save</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">SAVE writes PR_ProductionResult + updates tbl_Lot.RemainingQty + bumps WO completed.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">저장 시 PR_ProductionResult + tbl_Lot + WO 누적 업데이트.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">COMMON TASKS</span><span class="h-sec-ko">자주 쓰는 작업</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">A</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Good cycle</strong> — type qty + cycle sec → SAVE.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>정상 사이클</strong> — 수량/초 → 저장.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">B</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Defective cycle</strong> — tick the DEFECT box, SAVE → app jumps to INJ-005 for the code + qty.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>불량 발생 사이클</strong> — DEFECT 체크 후 저장 → INJ-005 자동 진입.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout warn">
            <div class="help-callout-i">⚠</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <span class="h-call-en"><strong>Cycle Sec must be > 0.</strong> If the cycle was interrupted, log it via INJ-008 Andon instead.</span><span class="h-call-ko">사이클 초가 0이면 저장 불가. 사이클 중단은 INJ-008 안돈으로.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
